      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lawrence%2C_Indiana",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Fall Creek, a tributary of the White River, flows through Lawrence’s northwest and even marks part of its boundary.",
